From 995e167f4acbca2b0ed2b29da6ec667d1da774d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Udita <udidua@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 06 May 2025 10:38:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-220857] gaudi3: pinctrl driver changes

The patch contains the  pinctrl driver
changes.The pinctrl driver is supported
by i2c and spi.
Other peripherals continue to use the pinmux
such as UART, efuse etc.

Change-Id: If0a4326ff8d136739b84d63e90a857ca210a74a9
Signed-off-by: Udita <udidua@habana.ai>
---

